		(property "Description" "RJ-11 6P6C THT jack, right-angle, unshielded, 125V/1.5A, -45 to +85C. Same Kinghelm family as the platform RJ-45 FTP jack (KH-RJ45-58-8P8C). Straight-through contacts, pins 1-6 (no shield/ground net) + 2 unnamed mechanical retention pegs (not modeled as electrical pins). Hub RJ-11 trust-channel jack J_SEC, populated per SKU (BOM-C)."
