		(property "Description" "TPS26621: 4.5-60V, 25-880mA industrial eFuse, auto-retry, adjustable OVP cutoff, input-side reverse-polarity protection to -60V. VSON-10 (DRC0010J), 3x3mm, 0.5mm pitch; PowerPAD (pin 11) ties to RTN (pin 5) per datasheet. Module mis-plug fail-safe eFuse ahead of the LDO, every ENT module family (survey 11 4th ruling)."
