		(property "Description" "256Mbit Serial NOR Flash, Standard/Dual/Quad SPI, 104MHz. SOIC-16 300-mil (Package Code F) — the FIQ variant carries a DEDICATED hardware /RESET pin (pin 3, separate from /HOLD-or-/RESET on pin1/IO3). 3.3V nominal. Hub boot flash, upgraded from W25Q128JV per REQ-HUB-COMMON-107 (32Mbyte-class NOR tier)."
